    "detailed_description": "Unwind from the stress of daily life with this magnificent marble maze. Sit down, tilt the maze to roll the ball and relax while listening to atmospheric sounds and a variety of music in lush environments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to Play, Effortless to Master</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/1243349b0c63b05f1e7c211317583748.poster.avif?t=1659484804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/1243349b0c63b05f1e7c211317583748.webm?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/1243349b0c63b05f1e7c211317583748.mp4?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The world is complicated enough and sometimes all you need is a place to let your mind wander. This is not a difficult game with complex puzzles, there are no timers, no leaderboards and most importantly, no pressure. It is a digital toy that invites you to relax, to breathe and to just for a moment let go of what was stressing you out in the real world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>200 mazes, ranging from relaxing to mildly challenging<br></li><li>5 Beautifully rendered environments with atmospheric soundscapes<br></li><li>Relaxing music covering LoFi Beats, Piano Ballads, Relaxing Folk, Chilled Electronica and Retrowave<br></li><li>Realistic ball rolling, impact and environment sounds with a delicate ASMR-like quality<br></li><li>Zen Mode, which plays back your current progress as a soothing screensaver<br></li><li>Ability to skip up to three mazes at a time if you ever get stuck<br></li><li>Steam Deck Verified, Tilt Five and VR support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">200 hand-crafted Mazes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/ddc49529f1df891834c3b62e75ecce87.poster.avif?t=1659484804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/ddc49529f1df891834c3b62e75ecce87.webm?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/ddc49529f1df891834c3b62e75ecce87.mp4?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The 200 playfully designed mazes in Marks Magnificent Marble Maze offer exciting puzzles and hours of fun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Five atmospheric Environments</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/080fe30a69e3487c7e26251515de72fd.avif?t=1659484804\" /></div><br>Each of the five environments invokes a sense of calmness, be it through the gentle sound of rain in the night, the rippling waves at the lake shore, the crackling fire, the gentle shaking of a train or the quiet static of an old TV.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Deck\u2122 Support</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/bf54bd3aaf296445ac5b0867970950b7.poster.avif?t=1659484804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/bf54bd3aaf296445ac5b0867970950b7.webm?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/bf54bd3aaf296445ac5b0867970950b7.mp4?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Mark's Magnificent Marble Maze supports the Steam Deck\u2122 including Gyro controls so you can play your mazes anywhere you go. The game provides two dedicated 60FPS graphics profiles, one for better graphics and the other for longer battery life. When using the &quot;The Void&quot; environment, the Steam Deck\u2122 will draw as little as 10W on medium brightness, giving you hours of game play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tilt Five\u2122 Support</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/89607ec3afbd140e84db3bdf8578e7a6.avif?t=1659484804\" /></div><br>Control the mazes by tilting your Tilt Five\u2122 Wand and experience Marks Magnificent Marble Maze using the Tilt Five\u2122 Glasses. Explore the beautifully rendered environments from new angles and play the game in holographic 3d.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experimental VR Support</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/cf2119cad52eacc0bbbd2ed535abb528.poster.avif?t=1659484804\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/cf2119cad52eacc0bbbd2ed535abb528.webm?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913200/extras/cf2119cad52eacc0bbbd2ed535abb528.mp4?t=1659484804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To learn more about experimental VR support, please visit this link: ",
